<p>Vessel	     ETA	   Cargo	    Quantity   Origin</p>
<p>Fannie	     unloading   corn	     25,611     U.S</p>
<p>				     wheat	    13,000</p>
<p>Cengis K	   unloading   gluten feed     8,151     U.S.</p>
<p>				     gluten meal     3,772</p>
<p>				     sorghum	   9,901</p>
<p>				     soya	     16,914</p>
<p>				     corn screening  5,999</p>
<p>				     wheat	     2,195</p>
